WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:14.280
[Animated graphic of a man shown from the waist up]

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:24.300
[Camera zooms in and fluoroscopic image of lungs is shown.]

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:31.760
[Apex, hilus, and base are indicated.]

00:00:31.767 --> 00:01:11.400
[Fluoroscopic image of lungs as person breathes in and out. Lungs expand and contract.]

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:26.800
[Fluoroscopic image of lungs rotates around the chest]

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:40.233
[Aortic arch, tracheal bifurcation, and carina are indicated. ]

00:01:40.233 --> 00:02:13.399
[Fluoroscopic images of lungs again appearing to rotate around the chest area]

00:02:34.533 --> 00:02:48.533
[Fluoroscopic images of lungs containing a tumor. The beating heart is seen.]

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:52.340
[Carcinoma]

00:02:56.400 --> 00:03:18.000
[Fluoroscopic images of lungs from different angles and sides of the chest; a mass is seen in upper right.]

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:22.900
[Carcinoma with abscess formation]

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:27.566
[Abscess is highlighted on left.]

00:03:27.567 --> 00:03:36.167
[Horizontal level of fluid in the abscess is indicated]

00:03:36.167 --> 00:03:55.620
[Images of the lungs with beating heart and dark spots indicating tumor and abscess]

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:30.320
[The person in the image rocks side to side; neck and shoulders are seen.]

00:04:41.167 --> 00:04:47.133
[Animated image of lungs sprinkled with small growths is shown. ]

00:04:47.133 --> 00:05:00.000
[Fluoroscopic images of lungs with tumors throughout.]

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:16.780
[Metastases of seminoma]

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:22.220
[Graphic of lungs with growths highlighted by crosshatch images]

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:30.700
[Bright fluoroscopic images of lungs with dark areas scattered near lower segments]

00:05:50.467 --> 00:06:10.000
[Images of lungs experiencing symptoms of bilateral spontaneous pneumothorax]

